WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:36.440
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:36.710 --> 01:38.979
[The Lament of Autumn]

3
01:39.390 --> 01:41.520
[Episode 22]

4
02:09.590 --> 02:10.180
Mom.

5
02:13.780 --> 02:14.740
I'm hungry.

6
02:28.350 --> 02:28.970
Come on.

7
02:40.960 --> 02:41.560
Mom.

8
02:44.300 --> 02:46.090
I made you worry.

9
02:53.660 --> 02:54.850
Sorry.

10
02:56.670 --> 02:58.960
I only thought of myself,

11
03:00.560 --> 03:03.080
and forgot the suffering you went through.

12
03:06.090 --> 03:07.420
Ever since I was little,

13
03:08.170 --> 03:10.300
every time I talked about that person,

14
03:10.740 --> 03:11.710
it was no different than

15
03:11.710 --> 03:13.310
rubbing salt in your wounds.

16
03:15.930 --> 03:17.870
But in order to protect me,

17
03:19.560 --> 03:20.960
you kept this secret to yourself

18
03:20.960 --> 03:22.210
for so many years.

19
03:23.900 --> 03:26.360
I can't imagine how upset you must have been.

20
03:38.890 --> 03:40.090
When I was a child,

21
03:41.650 --> 03:42.860
some people always

22
03:43.430 --> 03:44.780
called me a fatherless

23
03:44.780 --> 03:46.079
brat.

24
03:47.070 --> 03:49.040
But I never felt inferior.

25
03:50.020 --> 03:51.579
I always fought back

26
03:51.579 --> 03:52.800
without hesitation.

27
03:55.810 --> 03:58.230
Only now do I realize

28
04:00.640 --> 04:02.860
that he wasn't the one providing me

29
04:05.400 --> 04:07.560
with protection or confidence.

30
04:11.370 --> 04:12.370
It was you.

31
04:24.800 --> 04:25.690
Pingjun.

32
04:27.360 --> 04:29.430
I ask for very little.

33
04:30.550 --> 04:32.480
As long as you are happy,

34
04:34.090 --> 04:37.220
none of that suffering means anything to me.

35
04:41.980 --> 04:42.810
Mom...

36
04:44.360 --> 04:45.000
Pingjun.

37
04:56.659 --> 04:57.190
Mom,

38
04:59.450 --> 05:01.250
let's leave Nanhuai.

39
05:17.090 --> 05:18.690
Have you thought it through?

40
05:26.040 --> 05:27.100
Let's leave this place

41
05:27.100 --> 05:28.360
and everything behind

42
05:30.220 --> 05:31.830
for a brand new life.

43
05:35.159 --> 05:35.980
Pingjun,

44
05:36.930 --> 05:38.800
wherever you want to go,

45
05:39.740 --> 05:41.110
no matter how far it is,

46
05:42.200 --> 05:43.670
I will go with you.

47
05:55.180 --> 05:57.140
[A Tale of the Opera World]

48
06:03.750 --> 06:04.810
From now on,

49
06:06.680 --> 06:08.320
I won't sing opera again.

50
06:16.450 --> 06:17.720
Starting today,

51
06:19.170 --> 06:22.080
let's live a life of heavenly ease.

52
06:23.270 --> 06:24.340
Shall we?

53
06:30.250 --> 06:33.300
♪ Without going to the garden ♪

54
06:35.480 --> 06:47.270
♪ How could you see the spring scenery like this? ♪

55
07:10.560 --> 07:11.660
Tao Xili has acknowledged

56
07:11.660 --> 07:13.120
that mother and daughter.

57
07:13.860 --> 07:16.600
Their identities are confirmed.

58
07:18.000 --> 07:19.730
Who could've seen this coming?

59
07:21.370 --> 07:22.360
At first, I thought

60
07:22.360 --> 07:23.960
by leaving Tao Ziyi for a girl

61
07:24.040 --> 07:25.430
from humble origins, Yu Changxuan

62
07:25.430 --> 07:27.560
would completely antagonize Tao Xili

63
07:28.500 --> 07:30.160
and cause the Yu-Tao alliance

64
07:30.690 --> 07:31.950
to collapse on its own.

65
07:34.630 --> 07:35.750
Tao Xili feels awfully guilty

66
07:35.750 --> 07:36.810
for abandoning

67
07:36.810 --> 07:38.860
his other daughter Ye Pingjun years ago.

68
07:38.860 --> 07:40.270
Now, all of his attention

69
07:40.360 --> 07:42.130
is on no one but this girl.

70
07:42.890 --> 07:45.350
Besides, Yu Changxuan has special feelings

71
07:45.450 --> 07:46.430
for Ye Pingjun.

72
07:47.100 --> 07:49.159
He has fallen head over heels for her.

73
07:50.940 --> 07:52.150
I can say for sure

74
07:53.240 --> 07:55.240
that he will definitely marry her.

75
07:55.800 --> 07:57.659
Then it seems the Yu-Tao alliance

76
07:58.330 --> 08:00.330
will become even more unbreakable.

77
08:01.670 --> 08:03.610
This is the situation we are in now.

78
08:10.950 --> 08:12.610
What a pitiful girl.

79
08:14.000 --> 08:16.060
She finally went from rags to riches,

80
08:19.070 --> 08:20.730
only to have such a short life.

81
08:32.210 --> 08:36.679
[Prayer]

82
08:39.990 --> 08:44.380
[The body returns to dust, but true love never fades]

83
08:44.380 --> 08:45.140
[Thank you, Bodhisattva, for letting him return safely from the battlefield]

84
08:45.200 --> 08:45.580
[Or I wouldn't have had a chance to thank him in person]

85
08:45.580 --> 08:45.960
[I came specially to give thanks for my answered prayers]

86
08:45.980 --> 08:46.370
[May he and I both be well on our separate paths from now on]

87
08:46.370 --> 08:46.760
[May all his endeavors prosper]

88
08:53.820 --> 08:55.310
[Prayer]

89
09:16.620 --> 09:17.360
Come here.

90
09:17.520 --> 09:18.400
Sit down.

91
09:27.100 --> 09:28.830
I'll go make you some porridge.

92
09:28.950 --> 09:30.810
You stay here and rest for a while.

93
09:40.170 --> 09:41.200
Xueting.

94
09:44.000 --> 09:45.340
Sorry to have caused you

95
09:46.230 --> 09:47.590
so much trouble lately.

96
09:54.720 --> 09:55.460
You've never said

97
09:55.460 --> 09:56.170
that kind of thing

98
09:56.170 --> 09:57.080
to me before.

99
09:57.480 --> 09:58.320
Since when...

100
10:01.270 --> 10:02.820
did we become so distant?

101
10:12.070 --> 10:13.110
In a few days,

102
10:13.670 --> 10:15.400
after finishing the handover,

103
10:15.750 --> 10:16.750
I'll go to the pier

104
10:17.150 --> 10:19.080
to buy ferry tickets to Guangdong.

105
10:19.370 --> 10:21.960
I heard it's more stable and safer

106
10:23.150 --> 10:23.980
there.

107
10:25.480 --> 10:26.500
It is my mother's

108
10:26.910 --> 10:28.770
and my decision to go to the south.

109
10:29.670 --> 10:31.500
Your career has just taken off.

110
10:31.520 --> 10:32.170
Your home

111
10:32.170 --> 10:34.170
and your foundation are rooted here.

112
10:34.170 --> 10:34.700
I don't

113
10:34.700 --> 10:35.580
need you to make

114
10:35.580 --> 10:36.840
any sacrifices for us.

115
10:43.910 --> 10:44.720
Pingjun,

116
10:46.720 --> 10:47.720
I know you haven't

117
10:48.860 --> 10:49.960
forgiven me yet.

118
10:50.460 --> 10:51.660
I shouldn't have kept

119
10:52.360 --> 10:54.360
my relationship with Yuko from you,

120
10:55.460 --> 10:57.790
especially when I know better than anyone

121
10:58.650 --> 11:01.700
that nothing is more hateful to you than being deceived.

122
11:01.700 --> 11:03.500
Actually, over the past few days,

123
11:03.500 --> 11:05.630
I've been thinking over and over again

124
11:06.880 --> 11:08.910
about the nature

125
11:09.240 --> 11:10.530
of our relationship.

126
11:11.910 --> 11:13.930
We grew up together.

127
11:14.620 --> 11:15.980
For all these years,

128
11:16.460 --> 11:17.340
I've gotten used

129
11:17.340 --> 11:18.820
to you being around.

130
11:19.940 --> 11:21.340
So naturally, I started

131
11:21.340 --> 11:22.510
relying on you

132
11:23.070 --> 11:24.070
and trusting you.

133
11:26.190 --> 11:27.290
However, Xueting,

134
11:28.950 --> 11:30.200
is what we have

135
11:31.600 --> 11:33.030
really love?

136
11:35.250 --> 11:36.010
Pingjun.

137
11:40.170 --> 11:41.430
Are you giving up on me?

138
11:44.620 --> 11:45.410
No.

139
11:46.900 --> 11:48.010
I just haven't

140
11:48.010 --> 11:49.670
sorted out my feelings yet.

141
11:53.370 --> 11:55.300
That said, you are always my family

142
11:55.980 --> 11:57.440
under all circumstances.

143
11:58.740 --> 12:00.140
This will not change.

144
12:08.200 --> 12:09.000
Fine.

145
12:10.080 --> 12:11.610
Even as family, I still have

146
12:12.750 --> 12:14.950
the responsibility to take care of you.

147
12:15.630 --> 12:17.150
You and Aunt are traveling from north to south

148
12:17.150 --> 12:18.680
across thousands of miles.

149
12:19.010 --> 12:19.910
Nobody knows

150
12:19.910 --> 12:21.420
what might happen to you on the way.

151
12:21.420 --> 12:22.480
When you get there,

152
12:22.700 --> 12:24.830
you'll be strangers in a strange land.

153
12:25.170 --> 12:26.970
How do you expect me not to worry?

154
12:30.820 --> 12:31.880
Just let me keep you

155
12:32.050 --> 12:33.130
company and see it as my way

156
12:33.130 --> 12:34.660
to repay Aunt for raising me

157
12:39.120 --> 12:40.780
and to fulfill my filial duty,

158
12:42.140 --> 12:42.850
will you?

159
13:25.860 --> 13:31.890
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

160
13:31.930 --> 13:36.340
[Nanhuai Army No. 1 Depot]

161
13:49.220 --> 13:51.750
-Deputy Commander Yu. -Deputy Commander Yu.

162
14:26.670 --> 14:27.480
Excuse me.

163
14:27.660 --> 14:27.770
[Reception Office]

164
14:27.770 --> 14:28.890
How can I help you?

165
14:29.600 --> 14:30.900
Can you deliver

166
14:31.080 --> 14:31.820
an item

167
14:31.820 --> 14:33.480
to Deputy Commander Yu for me?

168
14:35.910 --> 14:36.630
Thank you.

169
14:37.680 --> 14:38.680
How may I call you?

170
14:39.080 --> 14:39.940
Ye Pingjun.

171
14:56.810 --> 15:02.020
[Guangyi Gate]

172
15:02.020 --> 15:05.840
[Nanhai Military General Staff Department]

173
15:36.100 --> 15:39.650
[Red maple leaves in gratitude for our encounter; wish you great success]

174
15:39.650 --> 15:41.650
My courtyard is full of maple trees.

175
15:42.940 --> 15:44.440
In late autumn, red leaves

176
15:45.840 --> 15:47.240
would flutter in the air.

177
15:48.290 --> 15:49.370
In a few days,

178
15:49.870 --> 15:51.170
when the maple leaves turn red,

179
15:51.170 --> 15:52.500
[Red Leaf Alliance]

180
15:52.500 --> 15:54.160
I'll admire the view with you.

181
16:06.230 --> 16:10.230
[The ferry is delayed due to heavy fog expected today and tomorrow]

182
16:13.620 --> 16:14.620
Here you are, Mom.

183
16:14.820 --> 16:16.820
Have some water. Careful, it's hot.

184
16:19.740 --> 16:20.510
Aunt,

185
16:20.630 --> 16:22.560
we'll spend the next few days here.

186
16:22.720 --> 16:23.920
This is not exactly a decent place,

187
16:23.920 --> 16:25.030
but it's close to the pier.

188
16:25.030 --> 16:26.340
Once the ferry service resumes,

189
16:26.340 --> 16:27.740
we can set off at any time.

190
16:27.870 --> 16:28.670
Sure.

191
16:29.510 --> 16:30.320
Xueting,

192
16:30.510 --> 16:31.840
don't worry about me.

193
16:32.440 --> 16:34.320
As long as you and Pingjun are around,

194
16:34.320 --> 16:36.390
I will feel at ease wherever we go.

195
16:40.120 --> 16:41.520
Aunt, eat something now.

196
16:41.980 --> 16:42.820
I'll go again and see

197
16:42.820 --> 16:43.670
if there's any news.

198
16:43.670 --> 16:44.220
Sure.

199
16:44.220 --> 16:45.340
I'll go with you.

200
16:45.870 --> 16:47.400
Mom, I'll go take a look too.

201
16:48.500 --> 16:49.030
Go ahead.

202
16:50.720 --> 16:51.410
Let's go.

203
17:24.420 --> 17:25.750
Who are you looking for?

204
17:27.810 --> 17:29.470
Are Ms. Ye and Miss Ye not home?

205
17:29.680 --> 17:31.010
They already moved out.

206
17:32.640 --> 17:33.500
They moved out?

207
17:34.920 --> 17:35.720
When?

208
17:36.310 --> 17:38.910
They said Xueting was taking them to the south.

209
17:38.920 --> 17:39.590
It would be either

210
17:39.590 --> 17:40.740
Guangzhou or Shanghai.

211
17:40.740 --> 17:42.400
They already left yesterday.

212
17:48.510 --> 17:53.110
[The ferry is delayed due to heavy fog expected today and tomorrow]

213
17:53.110 --> 17:54.380
Pingjun, it's fine.

214
17:54.720 --> 17:56.580
There is another pier to the east.

215
17:56.810 --> 17:57.610
You take care of Aunt.

216
17:57.610 --> 17:58.740
I'll go check it out.

217
17:58.940 --> 18:00.750
If there are private boats available

218
18:00.750 --> 18:01.610
to carry passengers,

219
18:01.610 --> 18:02.870
we'll set off tonight.

220
18:03.440 --> 18:04.300
That works too.

221
18:21.420 --> 18:22.270
Yu Changxuan.

222
18:24.680 --> 18:25.880
Deputy Commander Yu,

223
18:27.090 --> 18:28.020
what is this for?

224
18:32.440 --> 18:32.940
Yu Changxuan!

225
18:32.940 --> 18:33.940
-Move! -Xueting!

226
18:34.830 --> 18:35.770
Where will he be taken?

227
18:35.770 --> 18:36.500
Don't worry.

228
18:36.720 --> 18:37.880
He won't be hurt.

229
18:42.740 --> 18:44.600
Why do you have to stand in our way?

230
18:44.740 --> 18:47.070
Why did you leave without saying goodbye?

231
18:51.110 --> 18:52.010
You are well aware of

232
18:52.010 --> 18:53.070
my family affairs.

233
18:53.720 --> 18:54.850
I have decided to leave Nanhuai

234
18:54.850 --> 18:55.810
with my mother.

235
18:57.110 --> 18:58.210
So you bade farewell to me

236
18:58.210 --> 18:59.140
with a painting,

237
19:00.140 --> 19:01.070
having even no intention

238
19:01.070 --> 19:02.600
of speaking to me in person?

239
19:04.070 --> 19:05.400
I sent you that painting

240
19:06.440 --> 19:08.440
only to thank you for saving my life.

241
19:10.940 --> 19:11.980
Just to thank me?

242
19:17.680 --> 19:19.010
And to return the favor.

243
19:26.940 --> 19:28.270
You will never be able to

244
19:29.610 --> 19:31.210
repay what you owe me in full.

245
19:34.650 --> 19:36.470
Do you remember I once told you

246
19:37.530 --> 19:38.810
that a girl

247
19:40.160 --> 19:41.910
entered my life

248
19:43.270 --> 19:44.570
when I was at my lowest?

249
19:46.200 --> 19:47.860
Do you remember I also told you

250
19:48.510 --> 19:49.250
that I met that girl

251
19:49.250 --> 19:50.480
at Guanyin Pavilion?

252
19:51.680 --> 19:52.750
She taught me

253
19:54.110 --> 19:55.770
to wiggle free of obsessions.

254
19:57.720 --> 19:58.750
She also taught me

255
19:59.740 --> 20:01.600
that one should live for oneself.

256
20:12.770 --> 20:13.570
Ye Pingjun.

257
20:15.140 --> 20:16.440
That girl was you.

258
20:22.190 --> 20:23.790
You miss him a lot, don't you?

259
20:23.960 --> 20:26.090
Is he a loved one you care deeply about?

260
20:26.480 --> 20:27.410
I don't miss him.

261
20:30.140 --> 20:31.270
He's not a loved one.

262
20:31.920 --> 20:33.850
Pretending not to care for someone

263
20:34.590 --> 20:35.990
brings tremendous pain.

264
20:39.460 --> 20:40.450
It was you?

265
20:41.880 --> 20:42.680
It was me.

266
20:56.110 --> 20:57.270
Since heaven has arranged

267
20:57.270 --> 20:58.400
for us to meet again,

268
20:59.740 --> 21:01.340
I won't let go of you anymore.

269
21:17.380 --> 21:19.580
If your heart still holds a place for me,

270
21:21.940 --> 21:23.550
could you please stay?

271
21:38.530 --> 21:39.420
Yu Changxuan,

272
21:41.240 --> 21:42.090
perhaps we were

273
21:42.090 --> 21:43.420
indeed fated to bond.

274
21:44.510 --> 21:46.140
But it all ends here now.

275
21:47.440 --> 21:49.440
I'm leaving Nanhuai with my mother.

276
21:50.350 --> 21:51.400
Everything here will be

277
21:51.400 --> 21:53.000
irrelevant to me hereafter.

278
21:54.030 --> 21:55.890
I hope you will stop pestering me.

279
22:00.290 --> 22:01.220
Is there really no place

280
22:01.220 --> 22:02.350
for me in your heart?

281
22:07.380 --> 22:08.110
No.

282
22:16.640 --> 22:18.440
Then why did you pray for me?

283
22:20.640 --> 22:21.880
When you learned that I came back alive

284
22:21.880 --> 22:23.140
from the battlefield,

285
22:26.010 --> 22:27.140
you were delighted.

286
22:38.500 --> 22:40.160
I've made myself very clear.

287
22:41.610 --> 22:42.740
Deputy Commander Yu,

288
22:42.740 --> 22:44.000
please leave me alone.

289
22:49.610 --> 22:51.410
What if I insist you stay with me?

290
22:56.740 --> 22:58.140
Do you want what happened

291
22:59.930 --> 23:01.530
at Fengtai to repeat itself?

292
23:13.570 --> 23:14.380
Fine.

293
23:18.600 --> 23:19.770
As you wish.

294
24:10.010 --> 24:11.180
Release that man.

295
25:19.420 --> 25:20.220
Who are you?

296
25:20.980 --> 25:21.740
Let go of me!

297
25:21.980 --> 25:22.640
Let go!

298
25:22.810 --> 25:24.000
Let go of me!

299
25:37.010 --> 25:37.810
Pingjun.

300
25:39.030 --> 25:40.030
I'll go to the pier

301
25:40.240 --> 25:41.440
in a moment.

302
25:42.290 --> 25:44.070
Today, by all means, we must

303
25:44.070 --> 25:44.930
leave the city.

304
25:48.610 --> 25:49.870
You go pick up Aunt now.

305
25:50.030 --> 25:51.630
Let's meet at the pier later.

306
25:53.700 --> 25:54.400
Got it.

307
26:15.240 --> 26:15.880
Mom!

308
26:16.880 --> 26:17.510
Mom!

309
26:20.770 --> 26:21.310
Mom!

310
26:22.140 --> 26:22.940
Mom!

311
26:29.420 --> 26:30.770
Mom. Mom!

312
26:32.000 --> 26:32.500
Mom!

313
26:33.000 --> 26:33.500
Mom.

314
26:34.880 --> 26:35.530
Mom!

315
26:36.110 --> 26:36.750
Mom!

316
26:37.220 --> 26:37.720
Mom!

317
26:38.510 --> 26:39.010
Mom.

318
26:40.610 --> 26:41.180
Mom...

319
26:41.500 --> 26:42.400
Pingjun,

320
26:44.070 --> 26:47.640
the fire was set by a soldier.

321
26:47.810 --> 26:49.400
A soldier?

322
27:02.900 --> 27:04.030
Yu Changxuan did it.

323
27:06.240 --> 27:07.440
Pingjun...

324
27:26.180 --> 27:26.900
Mom.

325
27:27.830 --> 27:28.570
Mom!

326
27:29.440 --> 27:30.240
Mom!

327
27:30.610 --> 27:33.270
Mom, I'll get you out of here.

328
27:34.590 --> 27:35.400
Mom!

329
28:31.530 --> 28:33.330
What if I insist you stay with me?

330
28:35.310 --> 28:36.740
Yu Changxuan...

331
28:38.140 --> 28:39.010
Deputy Commander Yu,

332
28:39.010 --> 28:40.480
we've found Miss Ye's dwelling place.

333
28:40.480 --> 28:41.530
The pier and the road down the hill

334
28:41.530 --> 28:42.720
are all under our control now.

335
28:42.720 --> 28:44.050
Shall we make an arrest?

336
28:44.460 --> 28:45.250
Withdraw.

337
28:46.220 --> 28:47.200
Return to the headquarters.

338
28:47.200 --> 28:47.700
Yes.

339
29:08.240 --> 29:09.030
Deputy Commander Yu,

340
29:09.030 --> 29:11.030
Miss Ye's dwelling place is on fire!

341
29:23.440 --> 29:24.250
Hurry! Quick!

342
29:24.980 --> 29:25.640
Deputy Commander Yu!

343
29:25.640 --> 29:26.400
Stop. It's too dangerous!

344
29:26.400 --> 29:26.860
Go away!

345
29:27.740 --> 29:28.180
Where's water?

346
29:28.180 --> 29:29.380
Quick, go fetch water!

347
29:29.380 --> 29:30.580
Deputy Commander Yu!

348
29:33.510 --> 29:34.640
Somebody come help!

349
29:35.830 --> 29:36.560
Get them out!

350
29:36.740 --> 29:37.270
Yes!

351
30:17.580 --> 30:18.140
Quick!

352
30:18.160 --> 30:19.360
Deputy Commander Yu.

353
30:26.220 --> 30:27.010
Pingjun!

354
30:28.830 --> 30:29.380
Pingjun!

355
30:29.400 --> 30:30.440
-Halt! -Stop here!

356
30:30.440 --> 30:31.220
Let go of me!

357
30:31.270 --> 30:31.700
No entry!

358
30:31.700 --> 30:32.460
Let go of me!

359
30:32.680 --> 30:33.510
Pingjun!

360
30:57.050 --> 30:58.140
Bronchial lavage.

361
30:58.210 --> 30:59.050
Prepare normal saline

362
30:59.050 --> 31:00.500
and 5% glucose solution.

363
31:00.530 --> 31:01.080
Got it.

364
31:03.290 --> 31:04.350
[Ward 8]

365
31:04.350 --> 31:05.480
Fifth Young Master,

366
31:05.590 --> 31:07.500
Ms. Ye did not survive.

367
31:08.500 --> 31:09.680
Miss Ye is still being resuscitated.

368
31:09.680 --> 31:10.740
We will do our best.

369
31:21.140 --> 31:23.010
Blood pressure is 60 over 40.

370
31:25.530 --> 31:26.460
[Ward 8]

371
31:26.460 --> 31:27.120
Changxuan!

372
31:58.590 --> 31:59.720
[Ward 8]

373
31:59.720 --> 32:00.400
Dr. Dai,

374
32:00.740 --> 32:01.500
how is she?

375
32:02.110 --> 32:03.240
Fifth Young Master,

376
32:03.420 --> 32:04.680
we've done our utmost.

377
32:05.060 --> 32:05.570
However, given

378
32:05.570 --> 32:07.010
that the patient inhaled too much smoke,

379
32:07.010 --> 32:08.610
which caused severe hypoxia

380
32:08.980 --> 32:10.910
in her body and damage to her brain,

381
32:12.180 --> 32:14.510
she is now unconscious and unable to move,

382
32:14.920 --> 32:16.510
though she can still breathe.

383
32:16.510 --> 32:17.770
It is as if she has suken

384
32:18.180 --> 32:19.240
into a deep sleep.

385
32:22.680 --> 32:23.860
How long...

386
32:25.640 --> 32:27.040
will she be in this state?

387
32:27.620 --> 32:29.950
The patient is in very serious condition.

388
32:29.960 --> 32:32.350
The chances of her waking up are rather slim.

389
32:32.350 --> 32:34.700
Patients in this condition would usually die

390
32:34.700 --> 32:36.960
from organ failure caused by a deep coma.

391
32:37.430 --> 32:43.900
[Ward 8]

392
32:51.070 --> 32:52.530
I will do whatever it takes

393
32:55.220 --> 32:56.610
to revive her.

394
33:19.440 --> 33:21.990
Fifth Young Master, in cases like this,

395
33:22.250 --> 33:23.140
even top hospitals abroad

396
33:23.140 --> 33:24.240
can't do anything

397
33:24.510 --> 33:25.770
to help such a patient.

398
33:26.250 --> 33:27.780
The best solution possible

399
33:27.980 --> 33:28.850
is to take Miss Ye home

400
33:28.850 --> 33:30.680
and attend to her carefully

401
33:31.440 --> 33:33.830
after her vital signs become stable.

402
33:44.450 --> 33:44.740
[Chunfeng Troupe]

403
33:44.740 --> 33:45.940
We need to adjust some things

404
33:45.940 --> 33:47.670
during tomorrow's rehearsal.

405
33:47.830 --> 33:49.640
Professor Zheng, played by Yang, was supposed

406
33:49.640 --> 33:50.920
to take on a mission at a time

407
33:50.920 --> 33:52.140
of crisis in the third act.

408
33:52.140 --> 33:54.570
But now it's changed—he volunteers to take

409
33:54.610 --> 33:56.630
the students on a study tour to France.

410
33:56.630 --> 33:58.740
Got it. I'll tell him tomorrow.

411
34:19.889 --> 34:20.330
[The Communist Manifesto]

412
34:20.400 --> 34:23.460
[Chunfeng Troupe Repertoire]

413
34:23.460 --> 34:24.179
Please pass it around.

414
34:24.179 --> 34:26.489
[The Communist Manifesto]

415
34:28.110 --> 34:29.010
This is...

416
34:33.360 --> 34:34.070
Let me see.

417
34:36.230 --> 34:37.489
A friend from Shanghai

418
34:37.590 --> 34:38.650
brought this to me.

419
34:39.070 --> 34:41.199
Remember: keep it to yourselves only.

420
34:43.030 --> 34:44.090
During the summer,

421
34:44.100 --> 34:45.830
they held a meeting in the south

422
34:46.610 --> 34:48.810
and officially named the organization

423
34:48.929 --> 34:50.590
the Communist Party of China.

424
34:51.780 --> 34:53.670
My friend explicitly informed me

425
34:54.070 --> 34:55.000
that from now on,

426
34:55.530 --> 34:56.940
the ideological banner

427
34:57.630 --> 34:59.030
we uphold is Marxism.

428
35:00.540 --> 35:02.220
What is Marxism?

429
35:02.250 --> 35:03.250
Marxism

430
35:03.510 --> 35:04.510
regards equality

431
35:04.730 --> 35:06.590
as one of the basic value pursuits

432
35:06.800 --> 35:08.170
in the whole society.

433
35:08.840 --> 35:11.240
Its fundamental goal is to abolish classes

434
35:11.340 --> 35:12.400
and exploitation,

435
35:12.440 --> 35:15.370
to end the oppression and exploitation of man by man,

436
35:15.420 --> 35:16.210
and to enable the people

437
35:16.210 --> 35:17.880
to jointly own the means of production

438
35:17.880 --> 35:19.620
and jointly exercise state power.

439
35:19.620 --> 35:20.690
[Chunfeng Troupe Repertoire]

440
35:20.690 --> 35:22.620
What an excellent line of thought.

441
35:22.920 --> 35:23.920
The October Revolution

442
35:23.920 --> 35:24.980
ushered Marxism

443
35:25.070 --> 35:26.000
into China,

444
35:26.420 --> 35:27.750
allowing us today to see

445
35:28.010 --> 35:29.730
clearly that the central government

446
35:29.730 --> 35:31.400
is in reality the rule of feudal warlords,

447
35:31.400 --> 35:32.230
the landlord class,

448
35:32.230 --> 35:34.030
and the comprador bourgeoisie.

449
35:36.000 --> 35:37.800
We must hold fast to revolutions

450
35:38.210 --> 35:39.810
and overthrow their regime!

451
35:40.710 --> 35:43.380
But if we are to fight and wage a revolution,

452
35:43.630 --> 35:45.320
won't there be another war?

453
35:45.440 --> 35:46.630
The meaning of a war

454
35:46.880 --> 35:48.340
varies with its purposes.

455
35:48.340 --> 35:50.210
Fighting to rid the people of exploitation,

456
35:50.210 --> 35:51.510
oppression, and aggression

457
35:51.510 --> 35:52.690
by foreign enemies is a just war,

458
35:52.690 --> 35:55.420
whereas a war aimed at plunder and enslavement

459
35:55.480 --> 35:57.140
is an unjust war.

460
35:57.740 --> 35:58.800
Master Jin, Master Jin!

461
35:58.800 --> 36:00.530
Something terrible happened.

462
36:00.630 --> 36:01.660
You know what?

463
36:01.730 --> 36:03.400
Liang Wenbo and his fellows

464
36:03.460 --> 36:05.030
are talking about waging a revolution

465
36:05.030 --> 36:06.930
and overthrowing the government.

466
36:06.930 --> 36:09.330
Remarks like that could lead to execution.

467
36:12.340 --> 36:13.500
What exactly are they saying?

468
36:13.500 --> 36:15.560
Master Jin, this is no small issue.

469
36:15.610 --> 36:17.130
Once word gets out,

470
36:17.380 --> 36:19.710
nobody can save Xiangxi Hotel from peril.

471
36:20.010 --> 36:21.940
So you do know this is a major issue.

472
36:22.230 --> 36:23.030
Yes.

473
36:23.590 --> 36:25.560
How can you take some lines

474
36:27.170 --> 36:28.430
from a play seriously?

475
36:31.110 --> 36:33.070
They are working on a civilized drama

476
36:33.070 --> 36:34.530
and simply rehearsing it.

477
36:35.190 --> 36:36.850
The lines are inappropriate,

478
36:38.090 --> 36:39.290
but they can be fixed.

479
36:41.230 --> 36:42.030
That's right.

480
36:42.230 --> 36:44.510
These people are simply rehearsing a play.

481
36:44.510 --> 36:46.230
When will Miss Lan Qing take the stage?

482
36:46.230 --> 36:46.880
Oh, right.

483
36:46.880 --> 36:47.230
Today's

484
36:47.230 --> 36:48.730
performer is still Taochun.

485
36:48.730 --> 36:50.530
Every one of her recent shows has been a huge hit.

486
36:50.530 --> 36:51.320
Nonetheless,

487
36:51.320 --> 36:52.480
Miss Lan Qing's health

488
36:52.480 --> 36:53.630
is getting better.

489
36:53.670 --> 36:55.400
I'll go make arrangements now.

490
36:55.860 --> 36:56.990
That's more like it.

491
36:57.630 --> 36:58.760
Troupe Leader Qian,

492
36:59.400 --> 37:01.230
just mind your own business.

493
37:01.750 --> 37:02.850
Yes, sure.

494
37:04.770 --> 37:09.180
[Fengtai]

495
37:10.510 --> 37:11.730
Fifth Young Master, shall I...

496
37:11.730 --> 37:12.400
No need.

497
37:29.950 --> 37:30.610
[Fengtai]

498
37:30.610 --> 37:31.470
-Fifth Young Master. -Fifth Young Master.

499
37:31.470 --> 37:32.600
Fifth Young Master.

500
38:25.610 --> 38:26.540
Are you new here?

501
38:26.630 --> 38:27.510
Yes, Fifth Young Master.

502
38:27.510 --> 38:28.640
My name is Xiaotang.

503
38:30.340 --> 38:31.630
When I'm away,

504
38:32.320 --> 38:33.720
take good care of Miss Ye.

505
38:34.570 --> 38:37.510
If anything happens to her, I'll hold you accountable.

506
38:37.510 --> 38:38.670
Don't worry, Fifth Young Master.

507
38:38.670 --> 38:39.530
I will properly attend

508
38:39.530 --> 38:41.060
to Miss Ye with all my heart.

509
39:14.630 --> 39:15.440
Pingjun,

510
39:17.300 --> 39:18.900
don't be afraid of anything.

511
39:19.730 --> 39:21.380
I will always be with you.

512
39:47.630 --> 39:48.840
Greetings, Staff Officer Li.

513
39:48.840 --> 39:50.090
Quick. I need to meet with Mr. Yu now.

514
39:50.090 --> 39:52.150
Is the meeting for urgent matters?

515
39:52.710 --> 39:54.510
Are you even supposed to ask that?

516
39:54.510 --> 39:55.570
Fifth Young Master hadn't slept

517
39:55.570 --> 39:56.630
in the past three or four days.

518
39:56.630 --> 39:57.670
He went exhausted

519
39:57.840 --> 39:59.280
and fell asleep last night.

520
39:59.280 --> 40:00.190
If you do have urgent news,

521
40:00.190 --> 40:01.260
I'll go wake him up now.

522
40:01.260 --> 40:02.320
But if you don't...

523
40:02.340 --> 40:02.900
Boren.

524
40:06.440 --> 40:07.570
Fifth Young Master.

525
40:08.840 --> 40:10.970
What brings you here in early morning?

526
40:11.280 --> 40:12.990
You haven't been home for days.

527
40:12.990 --> 40:14.730
I really couldn't hide the truth anymore.

528
40:14.730 --> 40:15.400
Commander Yu and Madam Yu

529
40:15.400 --> 40:17.330
demanded you go home immediately.

530
40:23.110 --> 40:25.480
It's been days since you last came home.

531
40:26.320 --> 40:27.340
It seems the family

532
40:27.340 --> 40:28.050
means nothing

533
40:28.050 --> 40:29.940
to you at all in your heart.

534
40:32.510 --> 40:34.710
Are you still watching over Ye Pingjun?

535
40:37.940 --> 40:38.880
How did Miss Ye

536
40:40.230 --> 40:41.670
sink into a coma?

537
40:44.670 --> 40:47.130
She and her mother planned to leave Nanhuai.

538
40:47.420 --> 40:49.350
But the ferry service was delayed.

539
40:49.670 --> 40:51.800
A big fire suddenly broke out in the wooden house

540
40:51.800 --> 40:52.940
where they dwelled.

541
40:53.880 --> 40:55.140
Ms. Ye already passed.

542
40:57.010 --> 40:59.400
How could such a thing happen?

543
41:01.320 --> 41:02.780
Well, now you're spending

544
41:03.710 --> 41:05.820
all your time staying by her side.

545
41:06.030 --> 41:07.360
What do you mean by that?

546
41:19.940 --> 41:20.780
[Parties to be wedded] [Officiant]

547
41:20.810 --> 41:22.090
[Marriage Certificate]

548
41:24.440 --> 41:25.640
You are marrying her?

549
41:26.920 --> 41:28.340
I won't marry anyone but her.

550
41:28.340 --> 41:29.130
Ridiculous!

551
41:29.820 --> 41:30.620
You're crazy!

552
41:31.420 --> 41:33.280
She's in a deep coma now

553
41:33.530 --> 41:34.900
and will possibly remain

554
41:34.900 --> 41:36.500
in this state for a lifetime.

555
41:36.670 --> 41:38.470
Do you mean to leave the Yu family

556
41:39.030 --> 41:41.290
without an heir by marrying such a woman?

557
41:41.710 --> 41:43.570
Pingjun will definitely wake up.

558
41:46.010 --> 41:48.030
I will make sure she comes to.

559
42:01.670 --> 42:02.510
Director Gu.

560
42:04.030 --> 42:04.670
Where is Mr. Yu?

561
42:04.670 --> 42:05.800
He went out.

562
42:06.960 --> 42:08.110
Did he say when he would be back?

563
42:08.110 --> 42:09.480
No, he didn't.

564
42:09.860 --> 42:10.360
Director Gu,

565
42:10.360 --> 42:11.000
how about you

566
42:11.000 --> 42:12.200
wait here for a while?

567
42:17.190 --> 42:18.320
How is Miss Ye doing?

568
42:19.480 --> 42:21.510
Mr. Yu has been taking care of her day and night,

569
42:21.510 --> 42:23.320
but she's still in the same condition,

570
42:23.320 --> 42:25.250
showing no sign of waking up at all.

571
42:28.470 --> 42:29.670
I'd like to visit her.

572
42:30.230 --> 42:31.630
Then please come with me.

573
43:00.610 --> 43:01.780
When Fifth Young Master

574
43:01.780 --> 43:03.340
brought Miss Yu back to Fengtai,

575
43:03.340 --> 43:04.740
he specifically ordered

576
43:04.860 --> 43:07.190
fresh flowers to be placed here every day.

577
43:07.710 --> 43:09.640
The newspapers have to be today's,

578
43:10.110 --> 43:12.610
and the gramophone must play something

579
43:12.630 --> 43:13.730
pleasant

580
43:13.980 --> 43:14.910
and cheerful.

581
43:16.030 --> 43:17.380
Everything has to be prepared

582
43:17.380 --> 43:18.210
as if Miss Ye

583
43:18.210 --> 43:19.130
were awake.

584
43:19.440 --> 43:20.970
Negligence is not allowed.

585
43:32.480 --> 43:33.080
Xiaotang!

586
43:34.530 --> 43:35.340
Director Gu,

587
43:35.340 --> 43:36.190
that's the servant

588
43:36.190 --> 43:37.130
who brews herbs for Miss Ye.

589
43:37.130 --> 43:38.230
Please wait here for a moment.

590
43:38.230 --> 43:39.890
I have to go see what happened.

591
45:33.920 --> 45:34.570
Ruitong?

592
45:35.630 --> 45:36.960
What are you doing here?

593
45:37.760 --> 45:38.490
Changxuan.

594
45:40.030 --> 45:40.960
We haven't found

595
45:40.960 --> 45:42.610
Jiang Xueting's whereabouts yet.

596
45:42.610 --> 45:43.400
With the turbulent downstream

597
45:43.400 --> 45:44.800
and his severe injuries,

598
45:45.110 --> 45:46.840
I'm afraid he's probably dead.

599
45:49.110 --> 45:50.320
Search along the river.

600
45:50.320 --> 45:52.820
If you can't find him, then let it be.

601
45:52.820 --> 45:53.610
Yes.

602
45:55.170 --> 45:56.530
The investigation shows

603
45:56.530 --> 45:57.610
the wooden house where Ms. Ye dwelled

604
45:57.610 --> 45:59.470
went on fire due to the hay ignited

605
45:59.610 --> 46:00.810
by the burning stove.

606
46:01.840 --> 46:02.840
No other finding?

607
46:04.010 --> 46:04.900
So far, no.

608
46:09.070 --> 46:09.880
Good work.

609
46:10.210 --> 46:12.940
I'll spend most of my time in Fengtai these days.

610
46:13.070 --> 46:14.510
If you have anything to report,

611
46:14.510 --> 46:15.770
just come meet me here.

612
46:16.170 --> 46:17.230
Keep the news

613
46:17.700 --> 46:19.560
under wraps from Tao Xili for now.

614
46:20.940 --> 46:21.530
Got it.

615
46:22.630 --> 46:23.290
Changxuan,

616
46:24.880 --> 46:26.610
leave the investigation to me.

617
46:26.860 --> 46:28.590
I promise to give you an answer.

618
46:33.340 --> 46:34.130
Ruitong,

619
46:35.730 --> 46:36.660
I believe in you.

620
46:37.940 --> 46:39.140
You won't let me down.

621
46:41.150 --> 46:43.410
Fifth Young Master, Dr. Dai has arrived!

622
46:46.510 --> 46:47.640
Fifth Young Master.

623
47:26.450 --> 47:27.230
What's that?
